      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNGSI UTAMA\nbuild_qubo(scenarios, α, costs, budget, η)\nqubo_value(x, q, Q, constant)\n\nNGAPAIN?\nMenggabungkan risk kuadratik + penalti budget\nmenjadi fungsi skor biner F(x).\n\nOUTPUT\nQuboModel {q[30], Q[30,30], constant}",
